# The operator handbook pair is compared byte for byte by the drift check in
# .github/workflows/verify.yml, on both legs of its ubuntu/windows matrix.
# Checkout-time line-ending translation would make the bytes on a runner's disk
# differ from the bytes that were committed, so the comparison would fail on the
# windows leg however correct the renderer is. `-text` disables that translation
# for these two paths: committed bytes reach disk verbatim on every platform.
docs/USER-GUIDE.md   -text
docs/user-guide.html -text
